      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/mnlstandardph/status/1994063793090121791",
      "text": "#MSNews | The Department of Foreign Affairs (DFA), through the Philippine Consulate in Hong Kong, confirms that one OFW is missing while one is confined to the ICU of a local hospital following the Level 5 fire that engulfed a residential complex in Tai Po, New Territories.\n\nIt also reported that a total of 23 Filipino domestic workers required welfare assistance. | via Katrina Manubay\n\n📷 Agence France Presse\n\nFor more news updates, visit https://t.co/rmQCnNSOvI.",
